===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|gmw-cfr}} {{m|goh|zehan}}. The vocalic development is comparable to that in {{m|gmw-cfr|sehn||to see}}, i.e. Old High German ''-eha-'' was contracted and merged with ''-ia-'' (see the same in {{cog|nl|tien}}, {{m|nl|zien}}).

